# Local dev working folder — see dev-docs/README.md for the canonical layout.
# Durable: `plans/` (actionable plans/backlog), `designs/` (design reference +
# the game authoring standard), `checks/scripts/` + `checks/results/`,
# `todos.md`. Auto-purged by the dev-docs-cleanup skill: `temp/` (>1d, offload
# large output here to dodge the token gate), `checks/out/` (>14d, generated
# puzzle dumps), `bin/` (>7d, soft-deleted). Local working state, never
# committed. (game-design.md lives at dev-docs/designs/game-design.md — it was
# ignored by name here until 2026-07-16.)
/dev-docs/

# Inbox of feedback/coordination notes (`unread/` = needs action, `read/` =
# archive). Local working state, never committed — see the "Inbox hygiene"
# section in CLAUDE.md.
/inbox/